    "sections": [
      {
        "title": "分叉状态与日程",
        "kind": "highlights",
        "items": [
          {
            "text": "Sepolia 的 Glamsterdam 升级安排在明天 13:53 UTC。",
            "sourceTimestamp": "00:13:00",
            "seek": 780.0
          },
          {
            "text": "Sepolia 分叉前不接入构建者；分叉后可立即用普通 Sepolia ETH 存款。",
            "sourceTimestamp": "00:24:59",
            "seek": 1499.0
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "title": "客户端进展",
        "kind": "highlights",
        "items": [
          {
            "text": "第一轮影子分叉中，Nethermind（已在 2.1 修复）、Besu（节点连接和空区块）、ethrex（P2P）均有问题；第二轮顺利。",
            "sourceTimestamp": "00:07:43",
            "seek": 463.0
          },
          {
            "text": "focil-devnet-0 被意外关闭；重建因超级节点不足而失败，每个节点仅有 100 个验证者；以后将确保足够的超级节点覆盖。",
            "sourceTimestamp": "00:11:37",
            "seek": 697.0
          },
          {
            "text": "Prysm 为 Sepolia 发布 v7.2.1，修复构建者 proposer-settings 问题，默认启用部分数据列，并包含两亿 gas 上限。",
            "sourceTimestamp": "00:13:41",
            "seek": 821.0
          },
          {
            "text": "Teku 96.9.1 发布版不包含两亿 gas 上限；Teku 使用 develop 分支运行节点以支持该上限。",
            "sourceTimestamp": "00:20:41",
            "seek": 1241.0
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "title": "执行层：eth_call 的 gas 上限",
        "kind": "highlights",
        "items": [
          {
            "text": "Geth 存在 bug：eth_call 错误地把 gas 限制为单笔交易的 1600 万上限；修复涵盖 eth_call、trace_call、eth_simulate，应该体现在 execution-apis 规范中。",
            "sourceTimestamp": "00:30:33",
            "seek": 1833.0
          },
          {
            "text": "达成共识：修复应写入 execution-apis 仓库，而非 EIP 本身。",
            "sourceTimestamp": "00:32:11",
            "seek": 1931.0
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "title": "决策",
        "kind": "decisions",
        "items": [
          {
            "text": "Sepolia 分叉前不接入构建者，分叉前的构建者测试建议使用 Hoodi。",
            "sourceTimestamp": "00:25:50",
            "seek": 1550.0
          },
          {
            "text": "eth_call 的 gas 上限修复在 execution-apis 仓库跟踪，而非修改 EIP。",
            "sourceTimestamp": "00:32:11",
            "seek": 1931.0
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "title": "行动项",
        "kind": "actions",
        "items": [
          {
            "owner": "Maria Silva / Gary (Geth)",
            "text": "更新 execution-apis 规范，记录正确的 eth_call gas 上限行为，不套用 1600 万的单笔交易上限。",
            "sourceTimestamp": "00:32:00",
            "seek": 1920.0
          },
          {
            "owner": "EIP authors (Glamsterdam)",
            "text": "Glamsterdam EIP 作者在下次 EIP Editing Office Hour 前提交 PR，将提案移到 Last Call 状态。",
            "sourceTimestamp": "00:24:06",
            "seek": 1446.0
          }
        ]
      },
